## Components
- `src/mcp/` — Master Control Program (priority routing)
- `src/cron/` — Cron scheduler (background tasks)

## Responsibilities
- `MCP::decide(msg)` — Prioritize high-urgency messages
- Cron publishes `agent_run` every 5 seconds for maintenance
- Hourly maintenance triggers

